# COG-MATCHED-PAIRS results

Registered in forge/COG_MATCHED_PAIRS_PREREG.md and forge/COG_MATCHED_PAIRS_ADDENDUM_A.md (audit: MATCHED_PAIRS_AUDIT.md, published before the tests ran). Same data-quality rules, horizons, controls, splits and gates for every candidate; nothing was changed after results.

## Verdict: **No pair or leg passes the registered gates, the family-wise correction and the consistency rule.**

Eligible candidates (at least 60 in-sample days; registered rule): P0 yes, P1 yes, P2 yes, P3 yes, P4 yes, L-US yes, L-EU-Euribor yes, L-EU-ESTR yes

